  "prefLabel": "He-P 3008.18 Complaints and Non-Compliance",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "He-P 3008.18 Complaints and Non-Compliance. Upon receiving a complaint that an individual or facility listed in He-P 3008.02(a)-(f) is not practicing in accordance with this part, the department shall:\n\n(a) Investigate the complaint; and\n\n(b) If founded, refer the complaint to a relevant disciplinary body, such as the New Hampshire board of medicine.\n\nSource. #8529, eff 12-23-05; ss by #9725, eff 7-1-10 (from He-P 3008.17); ss by #12632, eff 9-28-18 (formerly He-P 3008.16); ss by #13530, eff 1-25-23",
